Type: Package
Package: methylCIPHERv2
Title: Calculate Epigenetic Clocks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hung", "Pham", , "amser.hoanghung@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8271-9355")),
    person("Kyra L.", "Thrush", , "kyra.thrush@yale.edu", role = "aut"),
    person("Yale University", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Calculates scores for CpG-based epigenetic clocks to support
    hypothesis-driven evaluation and research. A single function scores
    every supported clock from a beta matrix of DNA methylation values.
    Scoring runs on the local machine, and most clock weights are bundled
    with the package.  The larger weight sets are downloaded on request.
